# Derived artifacts are reproducible from corpus/ and are not tracked.
# Source material small enough to commit lives in corpus/ and IS tracked,
# so that a clone runs with no fetch step and every reader gets identical
# bytes. Large or restrictively licensed corpora get a fetch script instead.
